00:15:35,780 --> 00:15:38,780
But maybe that's not the way to introduce her.

324
00:15:38,780 --> 00:15:40,280
I just found out that

325
00:15:40,280 --> 00:15:41,780
Bill Gates' mother died in 1994,

326
00:15:41,780 --> 00:15:42,780
and his father remarried.

327
00:15:42,780 --> 00:15:46,280
And she's the woman who ran

328
00:15:46,280 --> 00:15:49,780
the, it was a Seattle art

329
00:15:49,780 --> 00:15:50,780
gallery.

